          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Ola Electric Pumps Rs 2,000 Crore Into EV and Battery Manufacturing to Boost Localisation",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Ola Electric Mobility has approved a Rs 2,000 crore capital infusion into its EV and battery cell manufacturing subsidiaries as part of a push to deepen localisation and vertical integration across its supply chain. The investment is aimed at strengthening the company's core two-wheeler EV business and scaling battery production at a time of intensifying competition from legacy players and new entrants. The move comes as Ola Electric faces profitability pressure and scrutiny over after-sales service quality.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/ola-electric-infuses-rs-2000-crore-in-ev-and-cell-manufacturing/articleshow/131114494.cms",
            "publisher": {
